2</label><caption><p>Number of replicates for which the statistic value is over the 0.5% threshold for the 5 regions, using the microsatellite (MS) and SNP maps.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><td></td><td></td><td align="center" colspan="3">MS map</td><td align="center" colspan="3">SNP map</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td colspan="6"><hr></hr></td></tr><tr><td align="left">Chromosome</td><td align="center">Locus</td><td align="right">AI</td><td align="right">DA</td><td align="right">KA</td><td align="right">AI</td><td align="right">DA</td><td align="right">KA</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left">1</td><td align="center">D1</td><td align="right">7</td><td align="right">84</td><td align="right">5</td><td align="right">16</td><td align="right">96</td><td align="right">6</td></tr><tr><td align="left">3</td><td align="center">D2</td><td align="right">41</td><td align="right">69</td><td align="right">29</td><td align="right">36</td><td align="right">68</td><td align="right">30</td></tr><tr><td align="left">5</td><td align="center">D3</td><td align="right">26</td><td align="right">1</td><td align="right">54</td><td align="right">22</td><td align="right">0</td><td align="right">60</td></tr><tr><td align="left">9</td><td align="center">D4</td><td align="right">21</td><td align="right">2</td><td align="right">70</td><td align="right">18</td><td align="right">0</td><td align="right">59</td></tr><tr><td align="left">10</td><td align="center">D5</td><td align="right">0</td><td align="right">1</td><td align="right">0</td><td align="right">0</td><td align="right">0</td><td align="right">0</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap></sec></back></article>